  (https://github.com/hashicorp/syntax), Copyright (c) 2020 HashiCorp, Inc.,
  Mozilla Public License 2.0. The source of these files is available at
  that repository.
- rego/: Rego grammar from open-policy-agent/vscode-opa
  (https://github.com/open-policy-agent/vscode-opa), Apache License 2.0.
- haskell/: Haskell grammar from JustusAdam/language-haskell
